OL,3,GNEWSAResort's free light festival
OL,4,Acelebrates 10th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA resort is unveiling 10 new artworks
OL,7,Fas it celebrates the 10th anniversary
OL,8,Fof its festival of light.
OL,10,FThirty artworks will shine in the
OL,11,FLightpool Festival 2026 in Blackpool,
OL,12,Fwhich takes place between 21-31
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FThe free festival will feature
OL,16,Fspectacular installations in the light
OL,17,Fart trail, 3D projection shows and
OL,18,Fpremieres by some of the world's
OL,19,Fleading artists, with the Bayeux
OL,20,FTapestry and the town's Stanley Park
OL,21,Ffeatured to mark its 100th year.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
