OL,3,GNEWSAResort's free light festival
OL,4,Acelebrates 10th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhil Holmes, the festival's artistic
OL,7,Fdirector, said the event would be "a
OL,8,Ftruly memorable experience that fosters
OL,9,Fcommunity building and the passion of
OL,10,Fyoung, emerging creatives".
